{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q416243","formula":"C₁₃H₁₈AlClTi","hill":"C13H18AlClTi","elements":["H","C","Al","Cl","Ti"],"composition":{"C":13.0,"H":18.0,"Al":1.0,"Cl":1.0,"Ti":1.0},"names":{"en":"Tebbe's reagent","ru":"Реагент Теббе"},"descriptions":{"en":"Tebbe's reagent is the organometallic compound with the formula (C5H5)2TiCH2ClAl(CH3)2. It is used in the methylidenation of carbonyl compounds, that is it converts organic compounds containing the R2C=O group into the related R2C=CH2 derivative. It is a red solid that is pyrophoric in the air, and thus is typically handled with air-free techniques.","ru":"Реаге́нт Те́ббе (химическая формула — (C5H5)2TiCH2ClAl(CH3)2) — это металлоорганическое соединение, используемое в органическом синтезе для метиленирования карбонильных соединений, то есть превращения соединений типа R2C=O в терминальные алкены вида R2C=CH2. Реагент Теббе представляет собой красное кристаллическое вещество, пирофорное в присутствии воздуха. Данное соединение было получено американским учёным Фредериком Теббе в 1978 году."},"fame":17,"pubchemCid":53384502,"mass":285.59,"charge":0,"smiles":"[CH3-].C[Al+]C.[CH-]1C=CC=C1.[CH-]1C=CC=C1.[Cl-].[Ti+3]","inchikey":"RHFNIWLZSDICFZ-UHFFFAOYSA-M","iupac":"carbanide;bis(cyclopenta-1,3-diene);dimethylalumanylium;titanium(3+);chloride","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q416243","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tebbe%27s_reagent","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A0%D0%B5%D0%B0%D0%B3%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%82_%D0%A2%D0%B5%D0%B1%D0%B1%D0%B5","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"properties","name":"PubChem","url":"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/comp